  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "the same…as 是常考句型，常出现在保持句意基本不变的句型转换练习中，所以学生一定要掌握以下句型："
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "A is the same + 名词 as B 与 A is as + 形容词的原级 as B 意思相同，在句中可以互换。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：This beautiful skirt is "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "the same"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " price "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "as"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " that red scarf."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "= This beautiful skirt is "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "as"
        },
